{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱしゃぱしゃぱしゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は生写真の撮影してきたよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真撮影はメンバー全員揃うので\n安心感がありますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も可愛い衣装いっぱい着たよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして中田とも喋った♪\nいつも楽しいです(。-ω-)｡°｡°｡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真の撮影は何着も\n衣装着るんだけど、自分のペースで\n進めるから早い子もいれば\n遅い子もいるのです(･ｰ･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、私はどっちなのかというと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう。お察しの通り遅い子(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいや、急ぐ気はあるし\n現に毎回急いでるし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも気づいたら100%の\n確率で最後まで残ってる(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイペースってなかなか\n直らないものです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/16/7535818/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真撮影の後は語彙読解力検定の\n準2級を受験してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回1位だったというのもあり、\nドキドキしながら受けたたんですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ〜めっちゃ\n難しかったヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果が怖すぎるんですけど\n受かってることを祈りつつ\n結果を待ちたいと思います(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/16/7535818/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくたーん♡\nこのいくたん\nなんか大人っぽい(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前バレッタの特典映像の\n個人PVが一部公開になりました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏は3回目の個人PV(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蜘蛛・デートと続き、\n今回は青山裕企さんに\n『守りたい、真夏』という題で\n病院で過ごす女の子として\nたくさん写真を撮って\nいただきました(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくリラックスして撮影\nできたので気張っていない\n表情を見せられたんじゃ\nないかなぁと思いますヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影すごく楽しかったので\nもし真夏が写真集を出させて\nもらえる機会が来たら\nぜひお願いしますっ(∩^ω^∩)\nなんてちゃっかり言って\nしまいました...ヽ(〃v〃)ﾉえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢は大きくっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDに収録されている本編も\nお楽しみに〜ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/16/7535818/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏にしては珍しい色の\nワンピースヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で着よっと♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、前に言ってたメイド服も\nまた7th中のどこかで着るからね〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜早く握手会の日\n来ないかなっ(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しくもう待てませんヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもそう思ってくれてたら...\n嬉しいなぁ(∩^o^)っ♡なんて♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/16/7535818/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママに握手会のこと話しながら\n自撮りをしていたらママが\n真夏の顔からピースを出しました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせtime♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前告知したばっかですが\n昨日はEX大衆の発売日(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニ・書店へgo♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡辺美優紀さんや\n須田亜香里さんなどなど\nいろんなアイドルさんと\n一緒の企画に出させて\nいただいてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい(っTωT)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちゃんの表紙が目印なので\nよろしくお願いしまーす♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして本日のうまズキッ！と\nMUSIC FAIRでバレッタの\n歌披露をさせていただいて\nいるので要チェックです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/16/7535818/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざっくり編み込んでみた〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーー、何年乗っても\n満員電車は苦手だよぉっ(｡´･ω･)\nと昨日の夜思った。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも電車乗ってたら未央奈が\n載ってるSPA!の中吊り\n発見したのです( +･`ｰ･´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SPA!にも乃木メンがちょこちょこ\n載ってるのでよかったら\nチェックお願いします♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よぉーし♪\n今日も撮影あるので\n頑張るぞっヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"}],"source":"archive"}